  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>The diameter of the objective lens,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math></p><p>The wavelength of the light,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2440</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>&#8728;</mo></mover></math></p><p>The resolving power of a telescope is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>D</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>22</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>24</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2440</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></math></p><p>Hence, the resolving power of a telescope is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></math>.</p>",
